# Rock, Paper, Scissors

A responsive browser game. Choose rock, paper, or scissors to play against the
computer; the first to five points wins the match.

## Controls

- Select one of the three move cards, or press **R**, **P**, or **S**.
- After a match ends, choose **Play again** to reset the score.

The game is built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript and runs directly in the
browser.
